Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 19:04:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/29] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20using=20=C2=B5m=20for=20copper=20t?=
 =?UTF-8?q?hickness=20when=20ODB=20UNITS=3DMM?=
